L207: Compression Ratio  | 2.5-5×  | 64.21× average  | 480× (Brotli)  | 97% reduction for structured text  | Exceeded
L208: Semantic Search Latency  | ¡50ms  | 30.54ms average  | 29.63ms minimum  | 39% faster than target on 1M vectors  | Exceeded
L209: Cryptographic Overhead  | ¡400%  | -7.6% (gain)  | -  | Performance gain from optimized data structures  | Exceeded
L210: Security & Integrity
L211: Tamper Detection Speed  | Real-time  | 2,420 MB/s  | -  | 100% detection rate during streaming  | Met
L212: Provenance Validation  | Complete  | 179ms for 100-link chain  | -  | 100% chain validity, immutable  | Met
L213: Privacy Processing  | Functional  | 95ms overhead  | -  | Encryption& anonymization successful  | Met
L214: Scalability & Production Readiness
